[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2479180997","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99252#issuecomment-2479180997","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99252","id":2479180997,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TxUzF","user":{"login":"filkata","id":1313329,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTMzMjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1313329?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata","html_url":"https://github.com/filkata","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-15T15:32:15Z","updated_at":"2024-11-15T15:32:15Z","body":"I have been able to simplify the code a bit while still reproducing the issue. I have simplified the random2f function and the previously mentioned lines now look like: ```point = 0.5 + 0.5*sin(fakeTime  + point);``` where I pass fakeTime from the editor.\r\n\r\n4.4 dev3:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bffdace2-7127-4872-a77f-59bb5ef24d4b\r\n\r\n4.4 dev4:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5082cffa-6e67-461c-a9a3-7b28ecb4dbce\r\n\r\nNew MRP: \r\n[shader_bug2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17777681/shader_bug2.zip)\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/247